<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Jan-Mar global trd deficit 374.0 bln esc.</title>
<headline>Portugal Jan-Mar global trd deficit 374.0 bln esc.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's global trade deficit rose to 374.0 billion escudos between January and March from 336.0 billion in same period last year, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>		   Jan-Mar 97 Jan-Mar 96    Mar 97    Feb 97</p>
<p> Overall balance -374.0    -336.0	 -134.1    -112.5</p>
<p> Imports	   1,288.8   1,292.4	 443.3     408.0</p>
<p> Exports	     914.8     956.4	 309.2     295.4</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in billions of escudos. A minus sign denotes a deficit. 1995 figures are definitive while 1996 figures are preliminary.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
